# Line endings.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true and deployed to
# Ubuntu. Without the rules below, every shell script is checked out with CRLF, copied
# to the VM as-is, and fails there with
#
#   /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
#
# which reads as a missing interpreter rather than as a line-ending problem and costs
# an afternoon to diagnose. Anything the VM executes or parses is pinned to LF.

*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
*.env.example   text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf

# Everything else is normalised in the repository and checked out per-platform.
* text=auto
